+---
+id: task-003-fix-coupon-cancellation-and-free-shipping
+type: task
+title: "Fix coupon cancellation and free shipping"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Request
+
+Correct two order-service behaviors reported by a customer and support:
+
+- A single-use welcome coupon used on an order must be available again after that order is cancelled, so the customer can place a corrected order.
+- Goods totaling exactly €50.00 must qualify for free shipping.
+
+## Acceptance
+
+- Place an order with a single-use coupon, cancel it within the allowed window, and successfully place another order with the same coupon.
+- Goods at exactly 5,000 cents incur no shipping charge; orders below the threshold continue to pay the weight-based shipping price.
